# suite TXMDCTL chain trace and measur
ok 1 - a trace without a company is refused with 08
ok 2 - a trace without a reference is refused with 08
ok 3 - an unsupported document type is refused with 08
ok 4 - the refusal carries a stable reason code
ok 5 - an unknown function is refused, not guessed at
ok 6 - both OTIF measures are published once each
ok 7 - supplier OTIF cites the decision that defines it
ok 8 - the control reports are in the report catalogue
ok 9 - an unknown order reference answers 16
ok 10 - an unknown reference is reported as broken
ok 11 - a live order yields at least one chain step
ok 12 - the first step is the accepted order schedule
ok 13 - the chain is named order to cash
1..13
